        "notes": "The color of the star's Gaia DR3 BP/RP spectrum. The darkening toward the edge is the quadratic law Claret & Bloemen (2011), A&A 529, A75 compute from ATLAS model atmospheres for the Johnson V band at 5,172 K and log g 4.45 (u1 0.607, u2 0.158): a model, because no fit of this star's limb is used. The spin axis's direction on the sky is a display convention."
